{"id":"wb-5-376","name":"潮州开元寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"开元寺 (潮州)","text":"潮州开元寺位于广东省潮州市湘桥区开元路，为佛教全国重点寺院。2001年6月25日，中国国务院列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n寺院始建于唐玄宗开元二十六年（公元738年）。开元寺最初名为“莲花寺”，元代称“开元万寿禅寺”，明代以后改称“开元镇国禅寺”，并沿用至今。\n受疫情影响，开元寺一度对外关闭。2020年7月，开元寺恢复开放。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%80%E5%85%83%E5%AF%BA_(%E6%BD%AE%E5%B7%9E)","revisionId":94091884,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94091884","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f072e18fcc2465cad6829681.jpg","title":"20230206_Kaiyuan_Temple,_Chaozhou_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230206_Kaiyuan_Temple,_Chaozhou_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/20230206_Kaiyuan_Temple%2C_Chaozhou_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Kaiyuan Temple, Chaozhou","width":320,"height":213}}